{"term":"geilt","lang":"nl","script":"latin","romanization":null,"category":"internet_subculture","subcategory":"arousal","concept":"sexual_arousal","is_novel_concept":false,"register":"slang_neutral","crude":45,"technical":0,"recognition_pct_current":88,"recognition_pct_peak":88,"peak_year":null,"regional":null,"definition":"Third-person singular present of Dutch 'geilen': to be turned on by, to get off on; as in 'het geilt me' (it turns me on) or 'hij geilt erop' (he gets off on it).","english_term":"turns on / gets off on","english_translation_quality":"approximate","notes":"'Geil' (adjective = horny) is the root; 'geilen op' is the verb construction; core Dutch slang predating internet culture, not exclusively subcultural vocabulary."}
