{"term":"sextortion","lang":"nl","script":"latin","romanization":null,"category":"internet_subculture","subcategory":"sexual blackmail","concept":"sextortion","is_novel_concept":true,"register":"loanword","crude":50,"technical":22,"recognition_pct_current":60,"recognition_pct_peak":65,"peak_year":null,"regional":null,"definition":"A portmanteau of 'sex' and 'extortion': the coercion of a victim using real, fabricated, or threatened sexual images as leverage to demand money, additional sexual content, or sexual acts under threat of exposure.","english_term":"sextortion","english_translation_quality":"direct","notes":"Novel concept: the financial or sexual extortion mechanism makes this categorically distinct from revenge porn (actual sharing) and from non_consensual_sexual_exposure (retaliation-focused); the threat of exposure is the instrument of control."}
